        {
          "text": "This command will cause the construct to "
        },
        {
          "text": "attempt to break any blocks in the given area",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nThe construct needs to be able to "
        },
        {
          "text": "break blocks",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " in order to perform this task.  The material of the part granting this capability (for instance, a hammer arm) will determine the level of mining the construct is capable of performing."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
